<title>GERMANY: Didier-Werke nine-month group sales fall.</title>
<headline>Didier-Werke nine-month group sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to</p>
<p>September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  968     down 3 pct</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit			8	 vs 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German manufacturer of blast furnace lining is Didier-Werke AG, a subsidiary of Austria's Radex-Heraklith Industrie-beteiligings-AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
